       "outcome_as_stated": "Mortality rate, treatment/control (convalescent plasma trial)",
       "timepoint_as_stated": "not stated",
       "why": "The companion paper is a serology study of convalescent plasma used in the REMAP-CAP and Argentinian CP trials. It reports no hydrocortisone-domain result. The only mortality figure is for the convalescent plasma domain, and it is a percentage with no counts, no OR and no 28-day timepoint. There is no 28-day all-cause mortality for hydrocortisone vs no hydrocortisone in the randomised population."
